不容易把自己的推测当成材料里的结论。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"把线索整理成提纲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先把相近的笔记放在一起，看看它们在回答什么问题。提纲暂定为三个部分：从一个阅读场景开始，展示一条笔记的变化，最后说明下一次可以怎样记录。"}]},{"type":"code_fence","attrs":{"language":"mermaid","currentMode":"render","fenceInfo":"mermaid","fenceClosed":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"flowchart LR\n    A[阅读资料] --> B[留下批注]\n    B --> C[整理线索]\n    C --> D[写出初稿]\n    D --> E[回查原文]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如果两条笔记的判断相反，先把它们并排保留，找出各自成立的条件。这个分歧可能比两条相似的摘录更适合作为文章的转折。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"给草稿留一点修改空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"初稿先回答问题，再调整表达。比如，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"revision","attrs":{"style":"indigo","mode":"revision","describe":"这句话把记录与写作之间的关系说得过于绝对。","advice":"清楚的笔记能为写作提供起点，文章还需要经过取舍、组织和修改"}}],"text":"只要做好笔记，就一定能写出好文章"},{"type":"text","text":"。改写时，把省略的条件补回来，观点才更准确。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"回读每一段时，检查它在做什么：交代背景、解释材料，还是提出判断？如果一段话同时承担太多任务，就拆成两段；如果删去之后意思仍然完整，就让它短一点。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"让读者看见一个想法是怎样形成的，也给他们留下继续思考的余地。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"下一次写作前"}]},{"type":"checkbox_list","content":[{"type":"checkbox_item","attrs":{"checked":true,"isCollapsed":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"确定这篇短文要回答的问题"}]}]},{"type":"checkbox_item","attrs":{"checked":true,"isCollapsed":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"为摘录补上自己的理解"}]}]},{"type":"checkbox_item","attrs":{"checked":false,"isCollapsed":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"选出一条最有代表性的笔记"}]}]},{"type":"checkbox_item","attrs":{"checked":false,"isCollapsed":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"按提纲完成初稿，补充具体例子"}]}]},{"type":"checkbox_item","attrs":{"checked":false,"isCollapsed":false},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"回查原文，删去没有依据的判断"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下次打开这份笔记，先从那个还没回答的问题开始。把新的发现写在旁边，看看今天的理解有没有变化，再决定文章需要怎样修改。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"相关笔记："},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"./Zditor注释与修订指南.md"}}],"text":"注释与修订"},{"type":"text","text":" · "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"./Mermaid使用指南.md"}}],"text":"流程图"}]}]},"format":{"metaContent":"---\ntitle:\n  type: text\n  label: 标题\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"阅读笔记与写作计划\"\nsubject:\n  type: text\n  label: 分类\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"阅读与创作\"\ndescription:\n  type: text\n  label: 摘要\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"留下阅读的线索，整理自己的判断。\"\ncover:\n  type: asset\n  label: 封面\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"../assets/marketing/reading-writing-cover-v1.webp\"\ncoverDark:\n  type: asset\n  label: 深色封面\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"../assets/marketing/reading-writing-cover-dark-v1.webp\"\nauthor:\n  type: text\n  label: 作者\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"SeeLey & Codex\"\nupdated:\n  type: date\n  label: 更新日期\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"2026-10-24\"\ntags:\n  type: text\n  label: 标签\n  description: \"\"\n  value: \"阅读 · 笔记 · 写作\"\ncol:\n  type: array\n  label: 封面文字\n  description: \"\"\n  value: [\"subject\", \"title\", \"description\"]\nrow:\n  type: array\n  label: 底部信息\n  description: \"\"\n  value: [\"author\", \"updated\", \"tags\"]\nwarm:\n  type: checkbox\n  label: 暖色调\n  description: \"\"\n  value: true\nwarmDark:\n  type: checkbox\n  label: 深色封面使用深色文字\n  description: \"\"\n  value: false\ndisplay:\n  type: checkbox\n  label: 显示属性\n  description: \"\"\n  value: false\n---","mainContent":"\n# 从阅读到一篇短文\n\n今天想写清楚一个问题：读过一份资料之后，怎样留下能继续使用的想法？先选一个值得追问的细节，回到原文，把它的意思和自己的理解分别写下来，再决定它能放进文章的哪个位置。\n\n==一条好笔记，既能带我回到原文，也能让我接着往下想。== 摘录负责保留线索，批注记录当时的疑问；写作时，再把这些片段连成自己的判断。\n\n!!! note 本次写作目标\n    写一篇关于阅读笔记的短文。用一个具体例子，说明一段摘录怎样经过追问、整理和改写，成为文章里有用的一段话。\n\n## 留下有用的阅读笔记\n\n每次记录，都给 [自己的理解](用自己的话解释这一段为何重要，并保留它在原文中的位置。|mode=tip|style=teal) 留一行空间。暂时不能确定的地方先写成问题，不急着把它变成结论。\n\n这次先读 [注释与修订指南](./Zditor注释与修订指南.md)，把其中的三条提示和自己的理解放在一起：\n\n| 资料里的原话 | 我的理解 | 在文章中的用法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 给一段文字补充说明，不改原文 | 先把问题留在原文旁 | 作为阅读场景的例子 |\n| 给一段文字提出替换建议 | 确认理解后，再进入改写 | 展示一句话的修改过程 |\n| 适合标一小段文字 | 每次批注只讨论一个问题 | 整理成最后的记录建议 |\n\n同一段文字，可以引出不同的理解。把“原文说了什么”和“我由此想到了什么”分开，之后修改观点时，就不容易把自己的推测当成材料里的结论。\n\n## 把线索整理成提纲\n\n先把相近的笔记放在一起，看看它们在回答什么问题。提纲暂定为三个部分：从一个阅读场景开始，展示一条笔记的变化，最后说明下一次可以怎样记录。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[阅读资料] --> B[留下批注]\n    B --> C[整理线索]\n    C --> D[写出初稿]\n    D --> E[回查原文]\n```\n\n如果两条笔记的判断相反，先把它们并排保留，找出各自成立的条件。这个分歧可能比两条相似的摘录更适合作为文章的转折。\n\n## 给草稿留一点修改空间\n\n初稿先回答问题，再调整表达。比如，[只要做好笔记，就一定能写出好文章](这句话把记录与写作之间的关系说得过于绝对。|mode=revision|style=indigo|advice=清楚的笔记能为写作提供起点，文章还需要经过取舍、组织和修改)。改写时，把省略的条件补回来，观点才更准确。\n\n回读每一段时，检查它在做什么：交代背景、解释材料，还是提出判断？如果一段话同时承担太多任务，就拆成两段；如果删去之后意思仍然完整，就让它短一点。\n\n> 让读者看见一个想法是怎样形成的，也给他们留下继续思考的余地。\n\n## 下一次写作前\n\n- [x] 确定这篇短文要回答的问题\n- [x] 为摘录补上自己的理解\n- [ ] 选出一条最有代表性的笔记\n- [ ] 按提纲完成初稿，补充具体例子\n- [ ] 回查原文，删去没有依据的判断\n\n下次打开这份笔记，先从那个还没回答的问题开始。把新的发现写在旁边，看看今天的理解有没有变化，再决定文章需要怎样修改。\n\n相关笔记：[注释与修订](./Zditor注释与修订指南.md) · [流程图](./Mermaid使用指南.md)\n","lineEnding":"\n","bom":"","hasFrontmatterSeparator":true},"nodes":[{"id":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","type":"heading","nodeType":"heading","path":[0],"parentId":null,"contentParentId":null,"children":["n.94060fd8-f4de5a70.0","n.25e17fe2-6f63d610.0","n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0","n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","n.96b402b8-1b8534ee.0"],"order":0,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"从阅读到一篇短文"},{"id":"n.94060fd8-f4de5a70.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[1],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":1,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"今天想写清楚一个问题：读过一份资料之后，怎样留下能继续使用的想法？先选一个值得追问的细节，回到原文，把它的意思和自己的理解分别写下来，再决定它能放进文章的哪个位置。"},{"id":"n.25e17fe2-6f63d610.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[2],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":2,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"一条好笔记，既能带我回到原文，也能让我接着往下想。 摘录负责保留线索，批注记录当时的疑问；写作时，再把这些片段连成自己的判断。"},{"id":"n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0","type":"admonition","nodeType":"admonition","path":[3],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.8553e481-6a3c3cdd.0"],"order":3,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"写一篇关于阅读笔记的短文。用一个具体例子，说明一段摘录怎样经过追问、整理和改写，成为文章里有用的一段话。"},{"id":"n.8553e481-6a3c3cdd.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[3,0],"parentId":"n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0","contentParentId":"n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0","children":[],"order":4,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"写一篇关于阅读笔记的短文。用一个具体例子，说明一段摘录怎样经过追问、整理和改写，成为文章里有用的一段话。"},{"id":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","type":"heading","nodeType":"heading","path":[4],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.d4ab9d90-bbb0aea0.0","n.6532929a-c74046a0.0","n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","n.78ebb3a9-2be233fb.0"],"order":5,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"留下有用的阅读笔记"},{"id":"n.d4ab9d90-bbb0aea0.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[5],"parentId":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":6,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"每次记录，都给 自己的理解 留一行空间。暂时不能确定的地方先写成问题，不急着把它变成结论。"},{"id":"n.6532929a-c74046a0.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[6],"parentId":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":7,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"这次先读 注释与修订指南，把其中的三条提示和自己的理解放在一起："},{"id":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","type":"table","nodeType":"table","path":[7],"parentId":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","n.8387df8d-8b34263.0"],"order":8,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"资料里的原话我的理解在文章中的用法给一段文字补充说明，不改原文先把问题留在原文旁作为阅读场景的例子给一段文字提出替换建议确认理解后，再进入改写展示一句话的修改过程适合标一小段文字每次批注只讨论一个问题整理成最后的记录建议"},{"id":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","type":"tr","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,0],"parentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","contentParentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","children":["n.702329a6-97eef146.0","n.58fc43db-2c0d7961.0","n.e3dfffd0-a0436cea.0"],"order":9,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"资料里的原话我的理解在文章中的用法"},{"id":"n.702329a6-97eef146.0","type":"th","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,0,0],"parentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","contentParentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","children":["n.edcab44f-3d6b7213.0"],"order":10,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"资料里的原话"},{"id":"n.edcab44f-3d6b7213.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,0,0,0],"parentId":"n.702329a6-97eef146.0","contentParentId":"n.702329a6-97eef146.0","children":[],"order":11,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"资料里的原话"},{"id":"n.58fc43db-2c0d7961.0","type":"th","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,0,1],"parentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","contentParentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","children":["n.cef8f6ca-15d54f34.0"],"order":12,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"我的理解"},{"id":"n.cef8f6ca-15d54f34.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,0,1,0],"parentId":"n.58fc43db-2c0d7961.0","contentParentId":"n.58fc43db-2c0d7961.0","children":[],"order":13,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"我的理解"},{"id":"n.e3dfffd0-a0436cea.0","type":"th","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,0,2],"parentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","contentParentId":"n.59ed7ee2-46defb6.0","children":["n.ed983bb3-a025891f.0"],"order":14,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"在文章中的用法"},{"id":"n.ed983bb3-a025891f.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,0,2,0],"parentId":"n.e3dfffd0-a0436cea.0","contentParentId":"n.e3dfffd0-a0436cea.0","children":[],"order":15,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"在文章中的用法"},{"id":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","type":"tr","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,1],"parentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","contentParentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","children":["n.69db0a6f-bd7e29bb.0","n.8356fa63-f36976c1.0","n.130803dd-e922c74f.0"],"order":16,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"给一段文字补充说明，不改原文先把问题留在原文旁作为阅读场景的例子"},{"id":"n.69db0a6f-bd7e29bb.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,1,0],"parentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","contentParentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","children":["n.e9f56f5e-8c490fa2.0"],"order":17,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"给一段文字补充说明，不改原文"},{"id":"n.e9f56f5e-8c490fa2.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,1,0,0],"parentId":"n.69db0a6f-bd7e29bb.0","contentParentId":"n.69db0a6f-bd7e29bb.0","children":[],"order":18,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"给一段文字补充说明，不改原文"},{"id":"n.8356fa63-f36976c1.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,1,1],"parentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","contentParentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","children":["n.90c743fc-9f9e5278.0"],"order":19,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"先把问题留在原文旁"},{"id":"n.90c743fc-9f9e5278.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,1,1,0],"parentId":"n.8356fa63-f36976c1.0","contentParentId":"n.8356fa63-f36976c1.0","children":[],"order":20,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"先把问题留在原文旁"},{"id":"n.130803dd-e922c74f.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,1,2],"parentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","contentParentId":"n.bc4356e2-8709610e.0","children":["n.23a06cfa-1ec180f6.0"],"order":21,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"作为阅读场景的例子"},{"id":"n.23a06cfa-1ec180f6.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,1,2,0],"parentId":"n.130803dd-e922c74f.0","contentParentId":"n.130803dd-e922c74f.0","children":[],"order":22,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"作为阅读场景的例子"},{"id":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","type":"tr","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,2],"parentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","contentParentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","children":["n.5e5ad98c-9592fda2.0","n.e2bd2e21-c1f1f23.0","n.f2600dbf-fc5ff255.0"],"order":23,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"给一段文字提出替换建议确认理解后，再进入改写展示一句话的修改过程"},{"id":"n.5e5ad98c-9592fda2.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,2,0],"parentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","contentParentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","children":["n.2b85489b-26f8d55b.0"],"order":24,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"给一段文字提出替换建议"},{"id":"n.2b85489b-26f8d55b.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,2,0,0],"parentId":"n.5e5ad98c-9592fda2.0","contentParentId":"n.5e5ad98c-9592fda2.0","children":[],"order":25,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"给一段文字提出替换建议"},{"id":"n.e2bd2e21-c1f1f23.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,2,1],"parentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","contentParentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","children":["n.d2fc7fbe-2a29ca9a.0"],"order":26,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"确认理解后，再进入改写"},{"id":"n.d2fc7fbe-2a29ca9a.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,2,1,0],"parentId":"n.e2bd2e21-c1f1f23.0","contentParentId":"n.e2bd2e21-c1f1f23.0","children":[],"order":27,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"确认理解后，再进入改写"},{"id":"n.f2600dbf-fc5ff255.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,2,2],"parentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","contentParentId":"n.d462e407-e2eaaa8f.0","children":["n.39d612c6-5a63a7cc.0"],"order":28,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"展示一句话的修改过程"},{"id":"n.39d612c6-5a63a7cc.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,2,2,0],"parentId":"n.f2600dbf-fc5ff255.0","contentParentId":"n.f2600dbf-fc5ff255.0","children":[],"order":29,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"展示一句话的修改过程"},{"id":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","type":"tr","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,3],"parentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","contentParentId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","children":["n.e1fec722-612f51fa.0","n.9322560e-55fac306.0","n.16062332-a83639a4.0"],"order":30,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"适合标一小段文字每次批注只讨论一个问题整理成最后的记录建议"},{"id":"n.e1fec722-612f51fa.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,3,0],"parentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","contentParentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","children":["n.779e8923-41cc4ba3.0"],"order":31,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"适合标一小段文字"},{"id":"n.779e8923-41cc4ba3.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,3,0,0],"parentId":"n.e1fec722-612f51fa.0","contentParentId":"n.e1fec722-612f51fa.0","children":[],"order":32,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"适合标一小段文字"},{"id":"n.9322560e-55fac306.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,3,1],"parentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","contentParentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","children":["n.a4c6fdf1-4e434bf.0"],"order":33,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"每次批注只讨论一个问题"},{"id":"n.a4c6fdf1-4e434bf.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,3,1,0],"parentId":"n.9322560e-55fac306.0","contentParentId":"n.9322560e-55fac306.0","children":[],"order":34,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"每次批注只讨论一个问题"},{"id":"n.16062332-a83639a4.0","type":"td","nodeType":"markdown","path":[7,3,2],"parentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","contentParentId":"n.8387df8d-8b34263.0","children":["n.7b49ea2f-2a23c1bd.0"],"order":35,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"整理成最后的记录建议"},{"id":"n.7b49ea2f-2a23c1bd.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[7,3,2,0],"parentId":"n.16062332-a83639a4.0","contentParentId":"n.16062332-a83639a4.0","children":[],"order":36,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"整理成最后的记录建议"},{"id":"n.78ebb3a9-2be233fb.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[8],"parentId":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":37,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"同一段文字，可以引出不同的理解。把“原文说了什么”和“我由此想到了什么”分开，之后修改观点时，就不容易把自己的推测当成材料里的结论。"},{"id":"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","type":"heading","nodeType":"heading","path":[9],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.a515eace-8974f44a.0","n.5e40bd48-6f041cd8.0","n.dcdef98d-53a45f1f.0"],"order":38,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"把线索整理成提纲"},{"id":"n.a515eace-8974f44a.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[10],"parentId":"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":39,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"先把相近的笔记放在一起，看看它们在回答什么问题。提纲暂定为三个部分：从一个阅读场景开始，展示一条笔记的变化，最后说明下一次可以怎样记录。"},{"id":"n.5e40bd48-6f041cd8.0","type":"code_fence","nodeType":"mermaid","path":[11],"parentId":"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":40,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"flowchart LR\n    A[阅读资料] --> B[留下批注]\n    B --> C[整理线索]\n    C --> D[写出初稿]\n    D --> E[回查原文]"},{"id":"n.dcdef98d-53a45f1f.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[12],"parentId":"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":41,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"如果两条笔记的判断相反，先把它们并排保留，找出各自成立的条件。这个分歧可能比两条相似的摘录更适合作为文章的转折。"},{"id":"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","type":"heading","nodeType":"heading","path":[13],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.6afbdbb3-e5ca12cd.0","n.890192a-bd4a1688.0","n.376d9ba-f7b75042.0"],"order":42,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"给草稿留一点修改空间"},{"id":"n.6afbdbb3-e5ca12cd.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[14],"parentId":"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":43,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"初稿先回答问题，再调整表达。比如，只要做好笔记，就一定能写出好文章。改写时，把省略的条件补回来，观点才更准确。"},{"id":"n.890192a-bd4a1688.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[15],"parentId":"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":44,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"回读每一段时，检查它在做什么：交代背景、解释材料，还是提出判断？如果一段话同时承担太多任务，就拆成两段；如果删去之后意思仍然完整，就让它短一点。"},{"id":"n.376d9ba-f7b75042.0","type":"blockquote","nodeType":"blockquote","path":[16],"parentId":"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.cdaacf34-d757450c.0"],"order":45,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"让读者看见一个想法是怎样形成的，也给他们留下继续思考的余地。"},{"id":"n.cdaacf34-d757450c.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[16,0],"parentId":"n.376d9ba-f7b75042.0","contentParentId":"n.376d9ba-f7b75042.0","children":[],"order":46,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"让读者看见一个想法是怎样形成的，也给他们留下继续思考的余地。"},{"id":"n.96b402b8-1b8534ee.0","type":"heading","nodeType":"heading","path":[17],"parentId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","n.eb2e0fc3-d650b563.0","n.8fb373de-c14f99fe.0"],"order":47,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"下一次写作前"},{"id":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","type":"checkbox_list","nodeType":"checkbox_list","path":[18],"parentId":"n.96b402b8-1b8534ee.0","contentParentId":null,"children":["n.4e9795b6-49e23dbc.0","n.d748b769-b29cd2c7.0","n.c6652723-90453559.0","n.9db45cc4-aa811f88.0","n.94d3a224-fcc402ec.0"],"order":48,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"确定这篇短文要回答的问题为摘录补上自己的理解选出一条最有代表性的笔记按提纲完成初稿，补充具体例子回查原文，删去没有依据的判断"},{"id":"n.4e9795b6-49e23dbc.0","type":"checkbox_item","nodeType":"markdown","path":[18,0],"parentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","contentParentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","children":["n.bc41e035-63aa43d.0"],"order":49,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"确定这篇短文要回答的问题"},{"id":"n.bc41e035-63aa43d.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[18,0,0],"parentId":"n.4e9795b6-49e23dbc.0","contentParentId":"n.4e9795b6-49e23dbc.0","children":[],"order":50,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"确定这篇短文要回答的问题"},{"id":"n.d748b769-b29cd2c7.0","type":"checkbox_item","nodeType":"markdown","path":[18,1],"parentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","contentParentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","children":["n.45a218a-89fb3b46.0"],"order":51,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"为摘录补上自己的理解"},{"id":"n.45a218a-89fb3b46.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[18,1,0],"parentId":"n.d748b769-b29cd2c7.0","contentParentId":"n.d748b769-b29cd2c7.0","children":[],"order":52,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"为摘录补上自己的理解"},{"id":"n.c6652723-90453559.0","type":"checkbox_item","nodeType":"markdown","path":[18,2],"parentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","contentParentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","children":["n.c8f1e633-19c26893.0"],"order":53,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"选出一条最有代表性的笔记"},{"id":"n.c8f1e633-19c26893.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[18,2,0],"parentId":"n.c6652723-90453559.0","contentParentId":"n.c6652723-90453559.0","children":[],"order":54,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"选出一条最有代表性的笔记"},{"id":"n.9db45cc4-aa811f88.0","type":"checkbox_item","nodeType":"markdown","path":[18,3],"parentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","contentParentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","children":["n.f62f1308-68b85cc2.0"],"order":55,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"按提纲完成初稿，补充具体例子"},{"id":"n.f62f1308-68b85cc2.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[18,3,0],"parentId":"n.9db45cc4-aa811f88.0","contentParentId":"n.9db45cc4-aa811f88.0","children":[],"order":56,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"按提纲完成初稿，补充具体例子"},{"id":"n.94d3a224-fcc402ec.0","type":"checkbox_item","nodeType":"markdown","path":[18,4],"parentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","contentParentId":"n.6f827185-88edbc55.0","children":["n.c55281b8-dd252ee6.0"],"order":57,"inline":false,"renderable":false,"preview":"回查原文，删去没有依据的判断"},{"id":"n.c55281b8-dd252ee6.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[18,4,0],"parentId":"n.94d3a224-fcc402ec.0","contentParentId":"n.94d3a224-fcc402ec.0","children":[],"order":58,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"回查原文，删去没有依据的判断"},{"id":"n.eb2e0fc3-d650b563.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[19],"parentId":"n.96b402b8-1b8534ee.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":59,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"下次打开这份笔记，先从那个还没回答的问题开始。把新的发现写在旁边，看看今天的理解有没有变化，再决定文章需要怎样修改。"},{"id":"n.8fb373de-c14f99fe.0","type":"paragraph","nodeType":"paragraph","path":[20],"parentId":"n.96b402b8-1b8534ee.0","contentParentId":null,"children":[],"order":60,"inline":false,"renderable":true,"preview":"相关笔记：注释与修订 · 流程图"}]},"bindings":{"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.7ca16e40-cc4526a2.0","path":[0],"inline":false},"n.94060fd8-f4de5a70.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.94060fd8-f4de5a70.0","path":[1],"inline":false},"n.25e17fe2-6f63d610.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.25e17fe2-6f63d610.0","path":[2],"inline":false},"n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.21603e70-c8d1a3f8.0","path":[3],"inline":false},"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.7c0d166f-a727f741.0","path":[4],"inline":false},"n.d4ab9d90-bbb0aea0.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.d4ab9d90-bbb0aea0.0","path":[5],"inline":false},"n.6532929a-c74046a0.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.6532929a-c74046a0.0","path":[6],"inline":false},"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.2bfebf4-d7037f7e.0","path":[7],"inline":false},"n.78ebb3a9-2be233fb.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.78ebb3a9-2be233fb.0","path":[8],"inline":false},"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.22cfea9f-a00c26db.0","path":[9],"inline":false},"n.a515eace-8974f44a.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.a515eace-8974f44a.0","path":[10],"inline":false},"n.5e40bd48-6f041cd8.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.5e40bd48-6f041cd8.0","path":[11],"inline":false},"n.dcdef98d-53a45f1f.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.dcdef98d-53a45f1f.0","path":[12],"inline":false},"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.a058fa50-9570951a.0","path":[13],"inline":false},"n.6afbdbb3-e5ca12cd.0":{"version":1,"documentId":"md.474165b3-676fa5","nodeId":"n.6afbdbb3-e5ca12cd.0","path":[14],"inlin